    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stack-based container.</para><para>The stack stores values in a last-in-first-out order. New items are pushed onto the top of the stack and existing items are popped from the top of the stack. </para>    </detaileddescription>
